{1 \over 2} H_{2} + {1 \over 2} Cl_{2} \to$ HCl

$\Delta H_{f}$ = –90 kJ $mol^{–1} \Rightarrow \Delta H_{f}$ = [ {1 \over 2}$(B.E)_{H<sub>2}</sub> + {1 \over 2}$(B.E)_{Cl<sub>2}</sub>] - (B.E)_{HCl}

$\Rightarrow$ -90 = [ {1 \over 2}$(430)_{H<sub>2}</sub> + {1 \over 2}$(240)_{Cl<sub>2}</sub>] - (B.E)_{HCl}

$\Rightarrow$ -90 = [215 + 120] - (B.E)_{HCl}

$\Rightarrow$ (B.E)_{HCl} =  425 kJ $mol^{–1}$

